            <ArticleTitle>Seat-Belt Use In US Counties: Limited Progress Toward Healthy People 2020 Objectives.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>636-639</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1377/hlthaff.2016.1345</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Spikes in automobile fatalities in 2015 and 2016 have renewed discussions about automobile safety. We measured the prevalence of reported seat-belt compliance in every US county from 2002 to 2012 and found considerable variation.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Project HOPE—The People-to-People Health Foundation, Inc.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
